# CODEOWNERS – Issue #223
#
# GitHub uses the LAST matching rule for a file, so more-specific rules must
# come AFTER broader ones.  Every path listed here requires a review from at
# least one member of the named team before a PR can be merged.
#
# Keep this file current as the team grows.  When a maintainer leaves, update
# their entry immediately so reviews are never silently unrouted.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md for how this file relates to branch protection.

# ── Fallback: core maintainers review everything not matched below ─────────
*                               @Ndi-Fi/maintainers

# ── Solidity / EVM stack ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/src/                           @Ndi-Fi/solidity-reviewers
/test/                          @Ndi-Fi/solidity-reviewers
/script/                        @Ndi-Fi/solidity-reviewers
/lib/                           @Ndi-Fi/solidity-reviewers
foundry.toml                    @Ndi-Fi/solidity-reviewers
remappings.txt                  @Ndi-Fi/solidity-reviewers

# ── Stellar / Soroban stack ───────────────────────────────────────────────
/stellar/                       @Ndi-Fi/stellar-reviewers

# ── Frontend (not yet in repo; placeholder for apps/web) ─────────────────
/apps/web/                      @Ndi-Fi/frontend-reviewers

# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/                          @Ndi-Fi/maintainers
*.md                            @Ndi-Fi/maintainers

# ── CI / DevOps ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/                       @Ndi-Fi/maintainers
